      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valle%2C_Arizona"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Valle hosts a Planes of Fame Air Museum that rotates WWI and WWII aircraft, including a Douglas AD‑4N Skyraider.",
